      "value": "<p><em>(6th Level)</em></p><p>You bank one prepared manifestation as a sigiled casting.</p><p>After deliberate preparation:</p><ul><li><p>Store one prepared manifestation as an inscribed annotation.</p></li><li><p>Later, cast it quickly without losing the stored working until the stored version is discharged.</p></li></ul><p>This does not remove misfire risk.</p><p>It front-loads stability.</p><p>You prepared yesterday so you can survive today.</p><p></p>",
